Changes from the originals: the captures were renamed into our own `jev` query group so
the plugin does not depend on that repository, the ecma file was copied into each of
javascript, typescript and tsx instead of using `; inherits:`, bare (arrow_function) was
narrowed to arrows bound to a variable, Go's func_literal was dropped, and Rust's
function_signature_item was dropped.
